rust-vmm/vhost-device c0bfee92: upstream PR rust-vmm/vhost-device#924, unchanged
(https://github.com/rust-vmm/vhost-device/pull/924, commit 65527605, open), for
issue #923 https://github.com/rust-vmm/vhost-device/issues/923.

vhost-device-can takes every available RX buffer in one pass but fills only as many
as it has frames. The rest are never returned. A pass with an empty frame FIFO
drops them all, the guest then has nothing to re-queue and never kicks RX again,
and RX stops for good. In this harness it showed as EDS no longer answering, on
about 1 boot in 15 under host load (campaign 2026-10-23). The PR takes only as many
buffers as there are frames.

